        "description": "Chimphobia is an immersive VR horror experience that takes players on a terrifying journey deep into the heart of fear itself. Using the innovative Gorilla Locomotion system, this game places you in the perspective of a desperate survivor navigating nightmarish environments that test your physical and mental limits. In Chimphobia, you must rely on your instincts, agility, and wit to survive against terrifyingly intelligent and relentless predators: hyper-aggressive, mutated chimpanzees. These creatures are not just hostile—they’re cunning, strategic, and deadly.",
